00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:43.230
It's going up!

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.720
How pretty!

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.020
It's nice and cool out.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:39.320
Thank goodness this Tanabata was sunny.

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:43.580
Indeed.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:02.760
May I 
get a 
girlfriend.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:11.180
May Mr. Handa's 
wish come true.

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:57.850
Trash

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:57.850
